    <p>Copyright Moonforge Labs Sp. z o.o. Source code: <a href={REPO_URL}>{REPO_URL.replace('https://', '')}</a>. You may use, study, share and change it under the terms of the <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html" rel="noopener">GPL-3.0</a>. The code that runs in your browser is exactly the code in that repository, built with <code>npm run build</code>.</p>
    <h2>Components</h2>
    <LicenseTable locale="en" />
